@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.global
@title Media loading — Global only
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Global only
@entry unload-current, unload-all, startup-restore, relay-source
@summary Show global window/workspace operations that can clear Files media or request a viewer source without belonging to one media tab.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-clear, functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag global

@alias window = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainWindow.PWindow
@alias workspace = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PWorkspace
@alias strip = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PStrip

[unload-current] Selected-workspace Unload command <input>
- Dispatch Unload to the selected workspace and clear its viewer, flow, Files content, and Merge group state @ window.PShortcutMediaClose(...)
  @ workspace.PWorkspaceMediaClear(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-clear

[unload-all] Unload All command <input>
- Dispatch Unload All and clear media content in every tab workspace @ window.PShortcutRun(...)
  @ strip.PStripContentClear(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-clear

[startup-restore] Automatic startup restore <input>
- Require automatic media restore, a nonblank saved path, and an existing file before scheduling the saved source for the active viewer @ window.PWindowMediaRestore(...)
> startup-result

[relay-source] Relay source arrival <input>
- Create and select the relay tab, then apply its relay payload to the workspace @ window.PWindowRelayAccept(...)
  @ workspace.PWorkspaceRelayApply(...)
> relay-result

[startup-result] Startup restore outcome <decision>
- Continue only when a valid saved media path was scheduled for an active viewer @ window.PWindowMediaRestore(...)
? "Viewer request scheduled" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "No restorable source" > startup-stop

[relay-result] Relay source outcome <decision>
- Require the relay workspace to have a viewer and the payload to contain a nonblank source before opening it @ workspace.PWorkspaceRelayApply(...)
? "Viewer request issued" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "No viewer source" > relay-stop

[startup-stop] Startup restore skipped <output>
= No shared viewer load begins.

[relay-stop] Relay has no media request <output>
= The relay payload does not start the shared viewer load.
